{
  "slug": "claude-xcindex",
  "name": "Claude Xcindex",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "An MCP bridge to Xcode's SourceKit symbol index for Claude Code. Provides sub-millisecond semantic Swift/ObjC symbol lookups — find references, definitions, overrides, conformances, and blast radius without grep or reading full files.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **2 commands**, **3 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `swift-blast-radius` (Compute the dependency blast radius of a Swift or Objective-C file — direct dependents, one hop of transitive…), `swift-find-references` (Find every semantic reference to a Swift or Objective-C symbol via Xcode's pre-built index — no false positives…), `swift-refactor-plan` (Produce a complete written refactor plan for Swift or Objective-C code — rename, signature change, type extraction, protocol…), `swift-rename-symbol` (Execute a semantic rename of a Swift or Objective-C symbol — type, method, property, protocol, enum case —…)\n- **Agents** (1): `swift-refactor-specialist` (Focused subagent for Swift/ObjC renames and signature changes using the Xcode semantic index)\n- **Commands** (2): `xcindex-setup` (Bootstrap xcindex in the current project — verifies the Swift binary, locates the Xcode project, optionally builds it…), `xcindex-status` (Check Xcode index freshness for the current project)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`, `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `xcindex`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-xcindex@claude-community` from `drewalth/claude-xcindex`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 3,
    "command": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
